          "textKh": "ឫស z₁ និង z₂",
          "text": "Roots",
          "latex": "z_1 = \\frac{2\\sqrt{2}-2i\\sqrt{2}}{2} = \\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{2}i, \\quad z_2 = \\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{2}i"
